Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:59.14,Title_CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,600)\pos(600,440)}前进之路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:38.06,Title_CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fs80\bord0\pos(495,380)}次回 私塾
